01:13:49.591 --> 01:13:52.635
<font face="Tahoma" color="#ffff00"><i><b>هيا نذهب</b></i></font>

723
01:13:53.595 --> 01:13:56.973
<font face="Tahoma" color="#ffff00"><i><b>اوهب نفسك لله
